{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "https://excalidraw.com", "elements": [{"id": "Pxygz5Zat2whwZxBSoPx8", "type": "text", "x": 6207.486727415059, "y": 4028.6718576062904, "width": 104.480224609375, "height": 20, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "bin", "roundness": null, "seed": 485499130, "version": 26, "versionNonce": 785852218, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1787060781638, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Design a uber ", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Design a uber ", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "vi_iWEqVYZbKUY3fzj6hb", "type": "text", "x": 5803.57027631431, "y": 4172.91358213988, "width": 601.4253540039062, "height": 700, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "bio", "roundness": null, "seed": 216315130, "version": 2582, "versionNonce": 1877826662, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1787069249188, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A. Functional Components\n\n1. Riders should be able to get a fare estimation based on start and end destination\n2. Rider must be able to request for ride based on estimated price.\n3. Rider should be able to request different catogories of ride\n4. Rider once starting searching the user must be able to find the driver nearby.\n5. Driver should be able to accept/ decline a request and \n6. Driver if accepted should  navigate to starting point\n7. Get real time tracking for user as well as driver\n8. [optional rating,payment] \n\nB. Non Functional requirement:\n1. CAP Theorem\n    - Availability > Consistency\n       - User must be able to see the drivers near by\n    -  Consistency > Availability   \n        - Fare seen by driver and user\n        - Ride matching user <-> driver\n2. Latency \n     - 1< min to match driver\n3. Estimates\n    - DAU - 100M10^8\n    - User Booking ride =  10% DAU = 10M\n    - Views per user per day = 10 => 10^8 \u00d7 10 = 10^9 (1B)\n    - QPS \n           Read = 10^9/10^5 = 10K qps\n            Write = 10^7/10^5 = 100 qps\n            100:1 read heavy =  cache + read replicas\n\n    - Peak 10\u00d7 \u2192 100K read, 1K write\n\n    - 10KB/ride (1KB row + GPS trail) \u00d7 10M = 100 GB/day \u2248 36 TB/year\n    - 1M online drivers, GPS ping every 4s \u2192 250K qps\n         - Redis geo-index (S2/H3), 30s TTL, not durable.\n", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "A. Functional Components\n\n1. Riders should be able to get a fare estimation based on start and end destination\n2. Rider must be able to request for ride based on estimated price.\n3. Rider should be able to request different catogories of ride\n4. Rider once starting searching the user must be able to find the driver nearby.\n5. Driver should be able to accept/ decline a request and \n6. Driver if accepted should  navigate to starting point\n7. Get real time tracking for user as well as driver\n8. [optional rating,payment] \n\nB. Non Functional requirement:\n1. CAP Theorem\n    - Availability > Consistency\n       - User must be able to see the drivers near by\n    -  Consistency > Availability   \n        - Fare seen by driver and user\n        - Ride matching user <-> driver\n2. Latency \n     - 1< min to match driver\n3. Estimates\n    - DAU - 100M10^8\n    - User Booking ride =  10% DAU = 10M\n    - Views per user per day = 10 => 10^8 \u00d7 10 = 10^9 (1B)\n    - QPS \n           Read = 10^9/10^5 = 10K qps\n            Write = 10^7/10^5 = 100 qps\n            100:1 read heavy =  cache + read replicas\n\n    - Peak 10\u00d7 \u2192 100K read, 1K write\n\n    - 10KB/ride (1KB row + GPS trail) \u00d7 10M = 100 GB/day \u2248 36 TB/year\n    - 1M online drivers, GPS ping every 4s \u2192 250K qps\n         - Redis geo-index (S2/H3), 30s TTL, not durable.\n", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "D30f1wesWVTFMyPboLS3Q", "type": "text", "x": 5826.408653410268, "y": 4867.791014915054, "width": 152.46642825100105, "height": 120, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "bmS", "roundness": null, "seed": 1935777082, "version": 471, "versionNonce": 1331334438, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787069479707, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "C. Core Entities\n    - Rider\n    - Driver\n    - Location\n    - Fare\n    - Ride/Trip", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "C. Core Entities\n    - Rider\n    - Driver\n    - Location\n    - Fare\n    - Ride/Trip", "autoResize": false, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "dkqZWDfarFzhEIevntRm1", "type": "text", "x": 6426.480317315497, "y": 4170.578661310623, "width": 903.07421875, "height": 240, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "bmV", "roundness": null, "seed": 107439142, "version": 1841, "versionNonce": 893757542, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1787069809360, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "D. API Design \n User \n\n    -  GET : /v1/api/fare?pickupLat=...& pickupLong=... & dropLat =.. & dropLong=... -> List[Fares], requestId based on Ride type \n    -  Post: /v1/api/rides/request {body: requestId}  //request all the drivers nearby -> returns rideTrackingId (if accepted)\n \n  Driver\n    - WS: /v1/driver/location- body{lat, long} - update driver location\n    - POST:/v1/ride - body{requestID, status: accepted/deny} -> return rideTrackingId\n    - POST:/v1/ride/{rideTrackingId}/start\n    - Post:/v1/ride/{rideTrackingId}/end\n       ", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "D. API Design \n User \n\n    -  GET : /v1/api/fare?pickupLat=...& pickupLong=... & dropLat =.. & dropLong=... -> List[Fares], requestId based on Ride type \n    -  Post: /v1/api/rides/request {body: requestId}  //request all the drivers nearby -> returns rideTrackingId (if accepted)\n \n  Driver\n    - WS: /v1/driver/location- body{lat, long} - update driver location\n    - POST:/v1/ride - body{requestID, status: accepted/deny} -> return rideTrackingId\n    - POST:/v1/ride/{rideTrackingId}/start\n    - Post:/v1/ride/{rideTrackingId}/end\n       ", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "h1", "type": "text", "x": 5840, "y": 5150, "width": 635.44, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 1651200956, "version": 100, "versionNonce": 895877191, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787160000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Design Uber  -  High Level Design  +  Deep Dive", "originalText": "Design Uber  -  High Level Design  +  Deep Dive", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "roundness": null}, {"id": "h2", "type": "text", "x": 5840, "y": 5194, "width": 755.0400000000001, "height": 15.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 721370779, "version": 100, "versionNonce": 1321091394, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787160000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "one diagram: the request path, the Redis driver lock that stops double booking, and how the thundering herd is contained.", "originalText": "one diagram: the request path, the Redis driver lock that stops double booking, and how the thundering herd is contained.", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "roundness": null}, {"id": "h3", "type": "rectangle", "x": 5840, "y": 5350, "width": 210, "height": 100, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 1786814443, "version": 100, "versionNonce": 1334142076, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787160000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "h4", "type": "text", "x": 5904.44, "y": 5364, "width": 81.12, "height": 16.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 668370103, "version": 100, "versionNonce": 1032643327, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787160000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Rider Client", "originalText": "Rider Client", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "roundness": null}, {"id": "h5", "type": "text", "x": 5907.82, "y": 5386.1, "width": 74.36, "height": 13.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 10